@SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5015
@DocumentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Swagger UI
# Abrir en navegador:
# {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger

### Crear documento
POST {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Introduccion a busqueda",
  "content": "Este documento explica search engines, indexing y ranking con tf idf.",
  "tags": ["search", "dotnet"],
  "author": "Ada",
  "category": "Tech"
}

### Listar documentos
GET {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Obtener documento por id
GET {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar documentos
POST {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "search indexing",
  "operator": "Or",
  "category": "Tech",
  "author": "Ada",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### Actualizar documento
PUT {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Introduccion a busqueda actualizada",
  "content": "Contenido actualizado para validar reindexado del motor de busqueda.",
  "tags": ["search", "ranking"],
  "author": "Ada",
  "category": "Tech"
}

### Eliminar documento
DELETE {{SearchEngine.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}
